{"code":0,"data":{"job_post_detail":{"id":"7678171242865101107","title":"屏幕显示工程师-2027校招","description":"1、参与显示屏主客观效果调优与显示问题分析，协助完成优化方案落地。\n2、协助与硬件、驱动、屏幕厂商沟通，跟进问题定位与解决进度。\n3、参与显示屏效果功能技术预研、显示屏评估及技术落地相关工作。\n4、协助完成显示屏选型、测试验证及交付过程中的基础工作。","requirement":"1、本科及以上学历，电子、光电、计算机、通信、自动化、物理、材料等相关专业应届毕业生；\n2、了解显示驱动开发基础，了解常见屏幕通信协议，如MIPI、RGB、eDP等；\n3、对色彩管理有基本认知，了解色域、色准、CCM/CGM、3D LUT等概念，逻辑分析能力良好；\n4、了解LCD/OLED等显示技术原理及屏幕主客观评价方法，无色盲、色弱，对显示效果优化有兴趣；\n5、有显示屏相关实习、项目、竞赛或毕业设计经验者优先。","recruit_type":{"id":"201","name":"正式","en_name":"Regular","i18n_name":"正式","depth":2,"parent":{"id":"2","name":"校招","en_name":"Campus","i18n_name":"校招","depth":1,"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"publish_time":1787713896189,"channel_online_status":1,"job_id":"7678171242864920883","city_list":[{"code":"CT_128","name":"深圳","en_name":"Shenzhen","location_type":3,"i18n_name":"深圳","py_name":"shenzhen","mdm_code":"MDCY00000249","node_status":1}],"job_post_info":{"recruitment_type":{"id":"201","name":"正式","en_name":"Regular","i18n_name":"正式","depth":2,"parent":{"id":"2","name":"校招","en_name":"Campus","i18n_name":"校招","depth":1,"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"HighlightList":[],"JobChannelPublishList":[],"job_post_object_value_map":{},"address_list":[],"city_list":[],"correlation_job_list":[],"tag_list":[],"storefront_list":[],"target_major_list":[],"job_post_process_time_list":[],"job_level_id_list":[]},"city_info_list_for_delivery":[{"code":"CT_128","name":"深圳","en_name":"Shenzhen","location_type":3,"i18n_name":"深圳","py_name":"shenzhen","mdm_code":"MDCY00000249","node_status":1}],"tag_list":[],"storefront_mode":1,"storefront_list":[],"process_type":2},"recommend_job_post_List":[]},"message":"ok","error":null}